{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/ac0c8a24d83764c32587eab9737e4d9e.poster.avif?t=1774448390\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/ac0c8a24d83764c32587eab9737e4d9e.webm?t=1774448390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/ac0c8a24d83764c32587eab9737e4d9e.mp4?t=1774448390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/c8ea939673762a7b9991996d4f5c5ef3.avif?t=1774448390\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> Turquoise</strong>, a <strong>cozy</strong> <strong>collecting</strong> and <strong>building</strong> game that immerses you in the heart of a protected marine area. In this peaceful space, you\u2019re free to imagine, decorate, and shape an environment where underwater life can flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f0a56c0b4610d5e3a7d735b9bce97174.poster.avif?t=1774448390\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f0a56c0b4610d5e3a7d735b9bce97174.webm?t=1774448390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f0a56c0b4610d5e3a7d735b9bce97174.mp4?t=1774448390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/b2210d3127c8657d97a5d879a82d5df4.avif?t=1774448390\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design</strong> the seabed with an intuitive decoration editor: place rocks, corals, plants, and objects to create a harmonious habitat. Every detail matters to attract and welcome new marine species, each more fascinating than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, observe, learn.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover new fish and creatures, you unlock their entries in the built-in <strong>encyclopedia</strong>, where you can learn more about their behaviors, preferences, and origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A calm, educational, and inspiring experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/d176f71a65f5b99320ce7511d995d4a7.avif?t=1774448390\" width=616 height=90 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable</strong> ocean zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive decoration <strong>editor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection</strong> of fish and marine creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated <strong>encyclopedia</strong> to learn more about discovered species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing</strong> and <strong>contemplative</strong> atmosphere. Care for your corner of the ocean, watch it evolve, and let marine magic unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe</strong> wildlife thrive in the environment you\u2019ve created</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800420?t=1774448390","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto