vironment where underwater life can flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f0a56c0b4610d5e3a7d735b9bce97174.poster.avif?t=1774448390\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f0a56c0b4610d5e3a7d735b9bce97174.webm?t=1774448390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/f0a56c0b4610d5e3a7d735b9bce97174.mp4?t=1774448390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/b2210d3127c8657d97a5d879a82d5df4.avif?t=1774448390\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design</strong> the seabed with an intuitive decoration editor: place rocks, corals, plants, and objects to create a harmonious habitat. Every detail matters to attract and welcome new marine species, each more fascinating than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, observe, learn.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover new fish and creatures, you unlock their entries in the built-in <strong>encyclopedia</strong>, where you can learn more about their behaviors, preferences, and origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A calm, educational, and inspiring experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/extras/d176f71a65f5b99320ce7511d995d4a7.avif?t=1774448390\" width=616 height=90 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable</strong> ocean zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive decoration <strong>editor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection</strong> of fish and marine creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated <strong>encyclopedia</strong> to learn more about discovered species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing</strong> and <strong>contemplative</strong> atmosphere. Care for your corner of the ocean, watch it evolve, and let marine magic unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe</strong> wildlife thrive in the environment you\u2019ve created</p></li></ul>","developers":["Low Flame Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800420/a6e40c7937a56f0324520761a9616b55b0b3033c/header.jpg?t=1774448390","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Turquoise. Developed by Low Flame Studio. Published by Milkshake Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800420/1577086489/5d6adb723485b9fb58f9c0dd5b9c595331eea9a2/1771605201/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771606066","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800420/1577086489/5d6adb723485b9fb58f9c0dd5b9c595331eea9a2/1771605201/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771606066","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800420/1577086489/5d6adb723485b9fb58f9c0dd5b9c595331eea9a2/1771605201/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771606066","id":257291215,"name":"Turquoise - Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257291215/31c138032edd9bb50cd7eabb21bfc1f44e64df0d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771606066"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3800420/575725672/bfa0d171048d766f8a3de0cd0d8a9a94530c649c/1762186534/d